  {
   "title": "The Sith–Imperial War",
   "date": "127–130 ABY",
   "view": "galaxy",
   "text": "The Fel Empire, grown from the Remnant into the galaxy's second power, goes to war with the Alliance — and the One Sith of Korriban, hidden for a century, ride the victory in. Ossus is massacred, Coruscant falls, and Darth Krayt takes the throne from the Emperor he had used. Roan Fel keeps a court in exile at Bastion; the Alliance keeps a fleet.",
