  {
   "title": "Krayt falls",
   "date": "137 ABY",
   "view": {
    "focus": "Coruscant",
    "w": 3400
   },
   "text": "Seven years of Sith rule end with Dac's oceans poisoned, the Jedi hunted from Ossus, and an alliance of the Galactic Alliance Remnant, the Empire-in-exile and the Jedi retaking Coruscant. Krayt dies on his own throne. What follows is a Galactic Federation Triumvirate — three governments, one map, and the oldest question in the galaxy: who keeps the lanes lit.",
